    "name": "Ninja Castle Escape",
    "steam_appid": 1387450,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387450/extras/ce7068b10e7b21b48a6a08d1be29efd9.poster.avif?t=1726636294\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387450/extras/ce7068b10e7b21b48a6a08d1be29efd9.webm?t=1726636294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387450/extras/ce7068b10e7b21b48a6a08d1be29efd9.mp4?t=1726636294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Use your creativity and ninja skills to escape from the booby trapped castle.<br>In each stage you must to solve the &quot;mystery&quot; and reach the exit door.<br><br>Ninja Castle Escape starts now!<br>Please enjoy this action puzzle game where your goal is to lead the ninja to a successful escape.<br><br>Activate all of the switches on a stage to open the exit door.<br>Time is limited and the clock is always ticking.  <br>Reach your goal before the countdown ends!<br><br>Also, as you progress through the stages, you will be able to acquire various ninja &quot;<i>ninjutsu</i>&quot; skills including <i>Shuriken</i> and <i>Katon</i> techniques.<br>Use your ninjutsu skills to solve the mysteries of further stages.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Escape from the Castle!</h2>Challenge yourself to solve all 50 castle stages<br>As you progress acquire <i>ninjutsu</i> skills<br>Your goal is escape!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Stage Editor Function</h2>Create you own castle designs using a Stage Editor.<br>Upload your designs to Steam Workshop and surprise everyone.<br>Download stages made by others for endless fun!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387450/extras/ce7068b10e7b21b48a6a08d1be29efd9.poster.avif?t=1726636294\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387450/extras/ce7068b10e7b21b48a6a08d1be29efd9.webm?t=1726636294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387450/extras/ce7068b10e7b21b48a6a08d1be29efd9.mp4?t=1726636294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Use your creativity and ninja skills to escape from the booby trapped castle.<br>In each stage you must to solve the &quot;mystery&quot; and reach the exit door.<br><br>Ninja Castle Escape starts now!<br>Please enjoy this action puzzle game where your goal is to lead the ninja to a successful escape.<br><br>Activate all of the switches on a stage to open the exit door.<br>Time is limited and the clock is always ticking.  <br>Reach your goal before the countdown ends!<br><br>Also, as you progress through the stages, you will be able to acquire various ninja &quot;<i>ninjutsu</i>&quot; skills including <i>Shuriken</i> and <i>Katon</i> techniques.<br>Use your ninjutsu skills to solve the mysteries of further stages.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Escape from the Castle!</h2>Challenge yourself to solve all 50 castle stages<br>As you progress acquire <i>ninjutsu</i> skills<br>Your goal is escape!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Stage Editor Function</h2>Create you own castle designs using a Stage Editor.<br>Upload your designs to Steam Workshop and surprise everyone.<br>Download stages made by others for endless fun!",
    "short_description": "Use your creativity and ninjutsu skills to escape from the booby trapped castle. Your goal is to lead the ninja to a successful escape. Also including a Stage Editor to share castle designs with others in Steam Workshop for endless fun. Ninja Castle Escape starts now!",
